// RS VR (1.8, owner): BD22's PURIST mode uses its own copy of every gun (PuristShot_Gun :
// Shot_Gun and so on), and a model is only ever drawn for the exact class it is defined for, so
// purist showed no guns at all. These are the same blocks, copied to each purist name.
// Generated from the pack's MODELDEF files; edit those, then copy again. Sniper: in since 1.93 (below).

